Feb 2008

Some random 'Winder pics. I probably have the only working Rev 6 'Winder.
The Rev 6 never went to production, so the crude looking back panel was a
rough mock up.

Not only does the 'Winder still boot, but last November I had to use it
as a backup when I had a disk crash on my router.

The other images are from a late model Rev 5.4 'Winder. 
